# Title: Office Macro File Creation
# ID: 91174a41-dc8f-401b-be89-7bfc140612a0
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-01-23
# Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.t1566.001
# Description: Detects the creation of a new office macro files on the systems
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((file_name="*.docm" OR file_name="*.dotm" OR file_name="*.xlsm" OR file_name="*.xltm" OR file_name="*.potm" OR file_name="*.pptm")) AND NOT (((process_path="C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\*" OR process_path="C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Office\\*") AND (process_path="*\\WINWORD.EXE" OR process_path="*\\EXCEL.EXE" OR process_path="*\\POWERPNT.EXE") AND file_name="*\\~$*")))
